cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Reproduction package for "Tournaments not inducible by five voters"
message: >-
  If you use this package, please cite the paper it accompanies. The
  package's own contents are indexed claim by claim in CLAIMS.md, which
  also lists what the package does not establish.
type: software
authors:
